==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[B.B.Bunny]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Bore]]s spawn, delay 24~28 seconds<sup>720f~840f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Just bring [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] into your lineup and this stage should be free. Anti-Red Crowd-Controllers such as [[Pirate Cat (Rare Cat)|Pirate Cat]] and [[Witch Cat (Rare Cat)|Witch Cat]] should also be good. In 4-crown difficulty, [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] makes this stage a joke.

